OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to lower speed limits to
OL,4,Aimprove road safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority has revealed plans to
OL,7,Fintroduce lower speed limits in five
OL,8,Fareas in a bid to improve road safety.
OL,10,FResidents are being asked for their
OL,11,Fviews on proposals to introduce a
OL,12,Fmixture of 20mph and 30mph limits in
OL,13,Fthe Wokingham borough, which the
OL,14,Fcouncil says represent the first phase
OL,15,Fof a longer term Safer Streets
OL,16,Fprogramme.
OL,18,FThe council said it aims to proactively
OL,19,Fintroduce safer speed limits,
OL,20,Fparticularly in places where
OL,21,Fpedestrians, cyclists and children may
OL,22,Fbe at risk.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
